    {
      "id": "67ca3e7f-f1bb-4591-a1e4-c5a4d1f2e821",
      "name": "Overview & imgmov.com Backlink",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -600,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 380,
        "content": "## Automated AI Visual Creation via imgmov\n\nGenerate high-resolution AI images and videos using the official REST API of [imgmov](https://imgmov.com/).\n\n- **Platform:** [https://imgmov.com](https://imgmov.com/)\n- **API Documentation & Console:** [https://imgmov.com/developer](https://imgmov.com/developer)\n- **Supported Models:** `agnes-image-2.1-flash`, `seedream-5-lite`, `nano-banana-2`, `gpt-image-2`, `kling-v3-omni`, `veo-3.1`\n\n### Requirements:\n1. Get your API Key from [imgmov Developer Console](https://imgmov.com/developer).\n2. Configure an **HTTP Header Auth** credential with `Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_API_KEY>`.\n3. The generation endpoint requires an imgmov account with API access enabled."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c138da30-9943-41bb-a5a4-2e909a32c253",
      "name": "Pipeline Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        140,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 380,
        "content": "## Polling & Delivery Pipeline\n\n1. **Trigger:** Receive prompt, model ID, and aspect ratio from an n8n web form or API webhook.\n2. **Dispatch:** Call `POST https://api.imgmov.com/api/v1/generate` to create the background rendering task.\n3. **Loop:** Poll `GET https://api.imgmov.com/api/v1/tasks/:taskId` every 10 seconds until `completed`.\n4. **Result:** Output final media CDN links from [imgmov](https://imgmov.com/)."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
